    "body": "i see you have avoid_negative_ts set to auto. could you try exporting with make_zero (the default) and see if resolve still shows the duplicate frames? losslesscut doesn't touch the frames themselves, so if VLC plays it fine i suspect resolve is having trouble with the timestamps at the start of the file",
